    "updated_at": "2020-05-05T08:41:17Z",
    "body": "This is what I wrote down:\r\n\r\n> `The <dfn export id=concept-domain-label>domain labels</dfn> of a <a>domain</a> <var>domain</var> are the result of <a>strictly splitting</a> <var>domain</var> on U+002E (.).`\r\n\r\nHowever, our domains are ASCII and the rendering section wants to talk about their Unicode counterparts so this probably needs more work to be fully proper.",
